  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 375°F (190°C).",
    "In a large skillet, heat olive oil over medium heat. Add garlic and onion and cook until softened.",
    "Add zesty beans, Algerian spice blend, tomato paste, and chicken broth to the skillet. Bring to a simmer.",
    "In a separate bowl, mix casserole pieces and feta cheese.",
    "Grease a 9x13 inch baking dish with olive oil.",
    "Add the bean mixture to the baking dish and top with the casserole-feta mixture.",
